 JUNE 28, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN DENTSPLY SIRONA INC. ("DENTSPLY" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: XRAY) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF DENTSPLY INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF OHIO. THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF ALL PERSONS OR ENTITIES THAT PURCHASED DENTSPLY\'S COMMON STOCK BETWEEN JUNE 9, 2021, AND MAY...'}{'symbol': 'XRAY', 'date': '2022-06-28 16:15:00', 'title': 'DENTSPLY SIRONA, INC. COMPANY NEWS: BERGER MONTAGUE INVESTIGATES SECURITIES FRAUD ALLEGATIONS AGAINST DENTSPLY SIRONA, INC. (NASDAQ: XRAY); LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE IS AUGUST 1, 2022', 'text': 'PHILADELPHIA , JUNE 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 BERGER MONTAGUE IS INVESTIGATING SECURITIES FRAUD ALLEGATIONS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED THE SECURITIES DENTSPLY SIRONA, INC. ("DENTSPLY" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: XRAY) BETWEEN JUNE 9, 2021 AND MAY 9, 2022 (THE "CLASS PERIOD"). IF YOU PURCHASED THE SECURITIES OF DENTSPLY DURING THE CLASS PERIOD, WOULD LIKE TO DISCUSS BERGER MONTAGUE\'S INVESTIGATION, OR HAVE QUESTIONS CONCERNING YOUR RIGHTS OR INTERESTS, PLEASE CONTACT ATTORNEYS ANDREW ABRAMOWITZ AT AABRAMOWITZ@BM.NET\xa0OR (215) 875-3015, OR MICHAEL DELL\'ANGELO AT MDELLANGELO@BM.NET\xa0OR (215) 875-3080 OR VISIT: HTTPS://INVESTIGATIONS.BERGERMONTAGUE.COM/DENTSPLY-SIRONA/\xa0 WHISTLEBLOWERS:\xa0ANYONE WITH NON-PUBLIC INFORMATION REGARDING DENTSPLY IS ENCOURAGED TO CONFIDENTIALLY ASSIST BERGER MONTAGUE\'S INVESTIGATION OR TAKE ADVANTAGE OF THE SEC WHISTLEBLOWER PROGRAM.'}{'symbol': 'XRAY', 'date': '2022-06-28 05:45:00', 'title': 'XRAY ALERT: THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF AUGUST 1, 2022 IN THE CLASS ACTION FILED ON BEHALF OF DENTSPLY SIRONA INC. SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': "NEW YORK , JUNE 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION COMPLAINT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF DENTSPLY SIRONA INC. (NASDAQ: XRAY) ALLEGING THAT 